crystal-clear rivers, and lush forests that stretch out beneath the watchful presence of the trees.\n\nElven figures in robes of shimmering silks, in soft whites, silvers, and golden hues, move gracefully through the city, their movements fluid and purposeful as they tend to their tasks or gather in quiet reverence to admire the view. The city's atmosphere is tranquil and contemplative, filled with the soft murmur of fountains and the distant song of birds that nest in the trees' vast canopies. The light of the trees reflects off the polished surfaces of the city's stone, creating a gentle interplay of shadows and illumination that shifts with the passing of each hour.\n\nFrom afar, the city appears as a jewel nestled in an ocean of verdant green, crowned by the two radiant trees that stand as guardians of this ancient, harmonious realm. The entire scene exudes a sense of timeless elegance and peace, as if untouched by the ages, a perfect sanctuary where the beauty of nature and the art of the elves coexist in perfect harmony, illuminated eternally by the light of the towering, magnificent trees, ancientstyle", 1.8], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 103, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP"}, {"widget": {"name": "t5xxl"}, "name": "t5xxl", "link": 107, "label": "t5xxl", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncodeFlux", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": {"0": 435.5473327636719, "1": 193.129150390625}, "pos": [544, 368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], "id": 43, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncodeFlux"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [57], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT"}, {"shape": 3, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT"}, {"shape": 3, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT"}], "size": {"0": 315, "1": 170}, "pos": [1119, 767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], "widgets_values": ["832x1216 (0.68)", 4, 0, 0], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 37, "type": "SDXLEmptyLat